			"styles": "\n\t/* a boundary run in a scope prelude stays where it was written */\n\t@scope (.a  ) {\n\t\tb {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t@scope (.a) to (.b ﻿) {\n\t\tb {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t@scope (.a /* c */ ) {\n\t\tb {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t@scope (.a)   to (.b) {\n\t\tb {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t@scope (.a) to ﻿ (.b) {\n\t\tb {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t@scope   {\n\t\tb {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n",
